{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Superpersons University is a comedy adventure deckbuilder game where 2 superpersons compete for a date with another superperson at the university. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose one of The Superpersons and play against the computer or online against another player.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play your cards right to impress your love interest and win a date, but don't get stuck in the &quot;friend zone.&quot;  Your archenemy will play any card to prevent you from getting the date.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there's a twist.  You don't know who your adversary is.  You need to pass notes (cards) to the other superpersons to discover who likes who.  That's what people do in university.  Only then, can you defeat your opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's more strategy than it seems.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The cards are made with official &quot;college ruled&quot; paper for an authentic college experience.  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's exactly like going to college again.  It's the fun of college without the annoying learning and effort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Superpersons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buff Bodysuit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699040/extras/ae5aec56e286ada5295a52a1be359c3e.avif?t=1769570249\" width=600 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunky Jorts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699040/extras/e6c4ad95d9a88702d23970d04048b54d.avif?t=1769570249\" width=600 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kitty Costume</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699040/extras/86e8f1ca7072ac6b0fbf2661d3e768b7.avif?t=1769570249\" width=600 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Red Undies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699040/extras/5a93e2ff9879a33a2ea81aba274486be.avif?t=1769570249\" width=600 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snazzy Vest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699040/extras/f7dab2648771239a863b4d75ab830840.avif?t=1769570249\" width=600 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swimsuit Ninja</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699040/extras/dbb41ed67be5bafd6a86a2782536572c.avif?t=1769570249\" width=600 height=500 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2699040?t=1769570249","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699040/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769570249","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699040/bc9f59a88b622721eed3823a771a352b0dca6195/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769570249","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699040/bc9f59a88b622721eed3823a771a352b0dca6195/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769570249","categories":[{"description":"Singl